;; spec:   stdlib §2.3 (Div), §7 L30, tranche 1 plan §2 C-8
;; expect: reject
;; error:  no implementation of Div for i64
;; roots:  ../../lib
;; `/` is Div's method in every module that :uses fib.core, and the
;; builtin `/` is shadowed there: fib.prelude// is not a readable name (the
;; tranche 1 plan, probe p2b). Div has no integer instance until L1, so
;; integer division is `quot` (R3) and a library part never writes `/` on
;; integers. When L1 lands the instances for i8 to i64, `(/ 7 2)` is the
;; ratio 7/2 and this case is deleted in that commit.
(ns main (:use fib.core))

(defun main () -> i64 (/ 7 2))
